        },
        {
          "text": "Dio kikeu emalaikat epei loti a ngikilinga amoru na etia akiries naapolon sodi achakakin nanam ebala, “Ikokinio ere loapolon a Babilon ewatario kwap nege, sodi nyeanyungar nabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
